    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milagi' ku'nguno ya ndi'pi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' iv'e ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li na ku'yi'si'nza ninga ku'yi'gu'zya, yi'lamudime ali'pe ng'ombe itano ku' ki'la ng'ombe yi'mo, na nkolo ine ku' ki'la nkolo yi'mo, na mbu'li ine ku' ki'la mbu'li yi'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' mwiv'i adimwe aho ali'bomola nnumba wu'ziku', nawe agu'mwe mpaka afwe, u'yo wa ku'muwu'laga akasye av'e na musango gwa kwita magazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi mwiv'i u'lu' adimwe itungo i'lo lyu'v'a lyadodomoka na ku'wu'lagwa, wa ku'muwu'laga alav'e na musango gwa kwita magazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sumbwa mwiv'i u'lu' adimwe, yi'li'mudima ali'pe. U'lu' ali' wu'du'hu' ki'ntu' cha ku'li'pa, haho mweni'ki'li' alagu'ziwe ki'gele ali'pe ku'nguno ya wiv'i wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' mutugo u'go gwali' gwiv'agwa gwigele mupanga mu makono gakwe, yi'v'e ng'ombe, mpunda, nkolo ninga mbu'li, yi'lamudime ku'li'pa zingi' iv'i'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' wazidi'mi'la mitugo zyakwe mu mugu'nda gwakwe ninga mugu'nda gwakwe gwa mizabibu, na ku'zileku'li'la mitugo zidi'mi'zye mu mugu'nda gwa muntu' yu'ngi', yi'lamudime ku'li'pa viliwa visoga ku'fuma ku' mugu'nda gwakwe mweni'ki'li' ninga ku'fuma ku' mugu'nda gwakwe gwa mizabibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' av'asye moto, nago gu'li'time itimba na ku'sambala mpaka ku'zigya matuntu ga viliwa vya v'antu' v'angi', ninga ku'zigya viliwa i'vyo vikaali' kwi'mbu'lwa, ninga mugu'nda gose gu'zige, wa ku'gu'v'asya moto gwenu'go yi'lamudime ali'pe musango gwenu'go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' amutu'u'li'zye muntu' mwiye feza ninga vintu' vingi', ali'vi vintu' vyeni'vyo viv'iwe mu lu'go lwa muntu' mwenu'yo, u'lu' mwiv'i igele yi'lamudime ku'li'pa kav'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi mwiv'i u'lu' waleka kwigela, haho musav'a nnumba yi'lamudime egele ha mbele yamwa Mulungu, ki'gele yigele nhana akav'ile hu' mwene wiv'aga nsawo ya mwiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ki'la igambo lya ku'pu'gana ku'nguno ya nsawo, li'v'e lya ng'ombe, mpunda, nkolo, mbu'li, vizwalo ninga lya ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho chatagi'kile, na ki'la yu'mo ali'yomba ati', ‘Yeni'yi' yi'li' nsawo yanne,’ igambo lyeni'li' lya v'antu' v'av'i'li' li'laletwe ha mbele yamwa Mulungu. U'yo Mulungu alayangu'le ku'v'a hu' mwene akenagu'lile, alamuli'pe mwiye kav'i'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' av'i'kye ku' mwiye mpunda, ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li, ninga mutugo gu'ngi', ki'gele amusu'ngi'le, na mutugo gwenu'go u'lu' gu'fwe, ninga ku'lumi'la, ninga ku'solwa bila muntu' ku'wona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hohene v'antu' v'enav'a v'av'i'li' v'alalahi'le ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a mwenu'yo muntu' akav'ile mwiv'i wa nsawo ya mwiye. Musav'a mutugo gwenu'go yi'lamudime azumye igambo lyeni'li', haho ku'lav'e ku'du'hu' ndi'pi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' mutugo gwenu'go gwiv'iwe ku' mwiye, yi'lamudime amuli'pe musav'a mutugo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' gwenu'go mutugo gu'tandagu'lwe na ndimu zya mu ipolu, muntu' u'yo ndi' watu'u'li'ziwa yi'lamudime agu'lete ki'gele yi'v'e wu'sangi'lwa. Haho ku'lav'e ku'du'hu' ndi'pi ku'nguno ya mutugo gwa ku'tandagu'lwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' watizya mutugo ku' mwiye, nago gu'vulali'ke ninga ku'fwa itungo i'lo musav'a mutugo ali'hadu'hu', yi'lamudime u'yo ndi' watizya ku'muli'pa mwiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' musav'a asangwe ali'ho ha mutugo, hohene u'yo wagu'tizizye akasye ali'pe ki'ntu'. U'lu' mutugo ndi' gwa ku'kodi, feza i'yo yali'pilwe ku' ku'kodi yi'lav'e yi'gelani'lile ku' ndi'pi ya mutugo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Milagi' ku'nguno ya kikali'le",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' wamuhu'mbi'ka muhala u'yo akaali' ku'kwiwa, na ku'lala nawe, yi'lamudime ku'mukwa ki'gele av'e muki' wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ise wa muhala mwenu'yo u'lu' akaane kukuntu ku'mutozya u'yo muhala ku' muntu' mwenu'yo, ninga vyeni'vyo yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo ku'li'pa nkwanwa i'yo yi'li'koov'iwa ku' mwaniki' u'yo akaali' muhala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
