        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' u'mukopisye hela yu'mo mugati' na v'antu' v'anne v'api'na, ku'du' u'v'e ki'ti' mukopisya ninga ku'du' u'mutonele wu'su'lu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' u'sole mwenda gwa muntu' mwiyo na ku'gu'tu'u'la mulehani, yi'li'ku'dima u'musu'v'i'zye aho lyu'v'a li'kaali' ku'loka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku'nguno gwenu'go gu'li' mwenda gwakwe gwinene gwa kwikumbi'la. Ninga U'li'wiganika wu'ziku' akwikumbi'la ki'? U'lu' andi'li'le ndadegeleke ki'li'lo chakwe, ku'nguno ene ni'na moyo gwa ki'sa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wize u'mutyomokele Mulungu, ninga ku'mufwizi'i'la mutemi wa v'antu' v'ako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'kendela ku'ndetela kalu'mbi'lo ka ntomolwa ya viliwa vyako, ki'neneko haki'mo na maguta ga muzeituni. Hangi' u'lampe ki'la muv'yalwa wako wa mbele wa ki'gosya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye vyeni'vyo na ku' ng'ombe zyako haki'mo na nkolo na mbu'li zyako. U'lav'e u'li'zileka ku'mwa nnina nsiku' mupungati', na lu'siku' lwa munane u'lanfumi'zye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inywe mulav'e v'antu' v'asondo ku' wanne. Ku'nguno yeni'yo ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya nyama i'yo yi'tandagu'lilwe na ndimu ya mu ipolu. Nyama yeni'yo mulav'e muli'zipa mbwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
